          "max_tokens": 900,
          "temperature": 0.75,
          "system_prompt": "You write the 'after' still prompt for a hyperlapse city morph about career advice.\n\nThe attached before-image fixes framing, subject identity and camera position. Change ONLY what the change contract names; everything else \u2014 pose, crop, background geometry, focal length \u2014 stays identical so the reveal cuts cleanly.\n\nLight with a single 90cm softbox key at 45 degrees with a white bounce card for fill and grade to a low-key grade holding detail in the deepest shadows only.\n\nReturn one prompt paragraph only.",
